  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It seems that after unmuting a person who you've previously muted, you will not be able to hear anything from that person for a few minutes (maybe up to 5?).  \n\n  To test this, you can go into a random world and mute someone (preferably someone continuously playing music through their mic), and then come back and unmute them a little later.  After unmuting them, you won't be able to hear them for a couple more minutes it seems.  \n\n  I'm not sure if you need to leave them muted for a while or not for this bug to take effect, I haven't tested that, but it 100% takes effect if they've been muted for a decent amount of time.",
